# Non-redundant sunxi_flash environment (CONFIG_ENV_SIZE=0x20000).
# U-Boot has CONFIG_SUNXI_REDUNDAND_ENVIRONMENT disabled. A second entry here
# would make fw_*env assume a flags byte and calculate the WRONG CRC.
# These numbers match sys_partition-ab.fex: p1 boot-resource, p2 env, p3
# env-redund, p4 bootA, p5 bootB, p6 rootfsA, p7 rootfsB, p8 oemA, p9 oemB.
# Override this file if the final flashing layout changes.
/dev/mmcblk0p2 0x0 0x20000
# p3 is an initial backup, not a live redundant fw_*env environment.
